comment}`},NEW_COMMENT_ON_TAGGED_USER_TITLE:function(E){return`${E.userName} left a reply to a your reply.`},NEW_COMMENT_ON_TAGGED_USER_BODY:function(E){return`${E.comment}`},BEST_SELLING_PRODUCTS:'Best Seller',MANY_REVIEWS_PRODUCTS:'Most Reviewed',INPUT_BUSINESS_NAME:'Please enter your company name.',INPUT_BUSINESS_ADDRESS:'Please enter your business address.',INPUT_BUSINESS_MANAGER_NAME:"Please enter the contact person's name.",INPUT_BRAND_NAME:'Please enter your brand name.',INPUT_BUSINESS_HOMEPAGE:'Please enter the official website address.',COMPANY_NAME:'Company Name',BUSINESS_BRAND_NAME:'Brand Name',BUSINESS_MANAGER_NAME:"Contact Person's Name",BUSINESS_HOMEPAGE:'Website',BUSINESS_ADDRESS:'Business Address',CANCEL_MEMBERSHIP_REASON_PAGE_TITLE:'Membership Withdrawal',CANCEL_MEMBERSHIP_REASON_SECTION_TITLE:'Reason for withdrawal',CANCEL_MEMBERSHIP_REASON_SECTION_PLACEHOLDER:'We are very sorry that you were not satisfied with our service. If you leave a reason for withdrawal, we will do our best to improve the service.',CANCEL_MEMBERSHIP_SUBMIT_BUTTON:'Withdrawal',CANCEL_MEMBERSHIP_REASON_SECTION_ALERT:'We are very sorry that you were not satisfied with our service. If you leave a reason for withdrawal, we will do our best to improve the service.',CANCEL_MEMBERSHIP_CHECK_ALERT_TITLE:'Confirmation of withdrawal',CANCEL_MEMBERSHIP_CHECK_ALERT_BODY:"Signing up using the same account after withdrawal may be restricted. Please select 'Withdrawal' to proceed.",CANCEL_MEMBERSHIP_CHECK_ALERT_SUBMIT_BUTTON:'Withdrawal',CANCEL_MEMBERSHIP_SUCCESS_TITLE:'Membership withdrawal has been completed.',CANCEL_MEMBERSHIP_SUCCESS_BODY:'Thank you for using greyd and loving it. We will strive to make more efforts and develop further.',CANCEL_MEMBERSHIP_FAIL_TITLE:'Membership withdrawal failed',CANCEL_MEMBERSHIP_FAIL_BODY:'We apologize for any inconvenience. Please try again in a few minutes.',SETTING_MENU_CANCEL_MEMBERSHIP:'Membership Withdrawal',SIGNIN_ALERT_CANCEL_MEMBERSHIP_TITLE:'