ome time.',PURCHASE_CANCELLATION_FAIL_TITLE:'Failed to cancel purchase request.',PURCHASE_CANCELLATION_FAIL_BODY:'Please try again in a few minutes.',WITHDRAWAL_PROCEEDING_ALERT_TITLE:'The withdrawal request is in progress.',WITHDRAWAL_PROCEEDING_ALERT_BODY:'After the previous withdrawal request is completed,\nyou can make a new request.',WITHDRAWAL_REQUESTS_LOADING_FAILED_MESSAGE:'Failed to load withdrawal request list. Please try again in a few minutes.',WITHDRAWAL_REQUEST_FAILED_MESSAGE:'The withdrawal request failed. Please try again in a few minutes.',PROCEED_PURCHASE:'Do you want to proceed with your purchase?',USER_ORIGIN:"User's country",USER_ORIGIN_GUIDELINES:'Please select your country.',USER_ORIGIN_SELECTION:'Country selection',ENTER_USER_ORIGIN:'Please enter country.',PRODUCT_ORIGIN:'Origin of the product',PRODUCT_ORIGIN_SELECTION:'Country selection',FAILED_TO_LOAD_USERS:'Failed to load user list. Please try again later.',USER_LIST:'User List',DisplayEntireUserCount:function(E){return`${E} Users`},USER_INSTAGRAM_ID:'Instagram Username',INSTAGRAM_ID_GUIDELINES:'Please enter your Instagram username.',CONDITION_USER_INSTAGRAM_ID:'Enter Instagram username',INSTAGRAM_ACCOUNT_CHANGE:'Change instagram account',INSTAGRAM_ACCOUNT_CONNECT:'Link Instagram account',INSTAGRAM_ACCOUNT_CONNECTION_FAILED:'Failed to connect to Instagram account.',INSTAGRAM_ACCOUNT_CONNECTION_FAILED_GUIDE:'Please try again in a few minutes.',CANCEL_RUNNING_JOB:'Cancel Running Job',CANCEL_RUNNING_JOB_GUIDELINE:'The running job has been canceled.',INSTAGRAM_SHARE_MODAL_GUIDE_1:'We are preparing to share on Instagram.',INSTAGRAM_SHARE_MODAL_GUIDE_2:'Do not close the app, please hold.',UPLOAD_TO_GCS_MODAL_GUIDE_1:'We are uploading the Video',UPLOAD_TO_GCS_MODAL_GUIDE_2:'Please wait for a moment.',QUESTION_TO_SELLER:'Ask the Seller',ASK_A_QUESTION:'Ask a question',HIDE_CONTRIBUTION_REVENUE:'Hide Contribution',CONTRIBUTION_HIDED:'Private',COPY_PROFILE_LINK:'Copy Profile Link',COMPLETE_COPY_PROFILE_LINK:'The profile link has been copied.',QR_CODE:'QR Code',LOWEST_PRICE_LINK:'Current Lowest Price',LOWEST_PRICE_INPUT_PLACEHOLDER:'Please enter the link to check lowest price',WRONG_LOWEST_PRICE_LINK:'The lowest price information URL is wrong',CHECK_LOWEST_PRICE:'Current Lowest Price',GREYD_GUIDE_WHAT_IS_GREYD:'What Is greyd',GREYD_GUIDE_HOW_TO_REVIEW:'How To Review',GREYD_GUIDE_HOW_TO_UPLOAD:'How To Upload',GREYD_GUIDE_HOW_TO_RELAY_REVIEW:'Relay Review',GREYD_GUIDE_GET_REWARD:'Get Reward',GREYD_GUIDE_BECOME_GREYDER:'Become greyder',GREYD_GUIDE_REVIEW_EVENT:'Review Event',GREYD_GUIDE_JOIN_EVENT:'Join Event',GREYD_GUIDE_TIER_DESCRIPTION:'Tiers',GREYD_TIER_GIVER:'Giver',GREYD_TIER_ARTISAN:'Artisan',GREYD_TIER_OPERATOR:'Operator',GREYD_TIER_STRIVER:'Striver',GREYD_TIER_EXPLORER:'Explorer',GREYD_TIER_PIONEER:'Pioneer',PROFIT:'Profit',GIVER_CONDITION:'Top 3%',ARTISAN_CONDITION:'Average Grade 8+ /\n Number of Grades 10,000+',OPERATOR_CONDITION:'Average Grade 7+ /\n Number of Grades 1,000+',STRIVER_CONDITION:'Number of Reviews 3+ /\n Number of Grades 100+',EXPLORER_CONDITION:'Number of Reviews 1+ /\n Number of Grades 40+',PIONEER_CONDITION:'Number of Reviews Graded 15+ /\n Number of Comments Written 10+',GREYD_COUNT:'Grades',NATIONALITY:'Nationality',TIER:'Tier',TIER_DESCRIPTION:'Tier Description',MY_PAGE:'My Page',STORE_SCREEN_CATEGORIES:{HOME:'Home',GOOGLE_PROMOTION_EVENT:'New Year Event',REFUND_EVENT:'100% Refund',SPECIAL_PRICE:'Promotions',NEW:'NEW',BEST_SELLING:'Best',MANY_REVIEWS:'Popular'},G6_DESCRIPTION:{GENERAL:{TITLE:'greyd 6 Tiers',CONTENT_1:'The greyd Tier is a ratings system based on the qualifications and achievements of greyders.',CONTENT_2:'The higher the rating, the higher the return on rewards paid to the greyders, along with more exposure to other users.'},GIVER:{CONTENT_1:'You are a',CONTENT_2:', part of an exclusive group that consists of only the top 3% of greyders globally.',CONTENT_3:"As one of the world's most accomplished and influential greyders, the",CONTENT_4:'is qualified to represent all greyders and present only the most reliable and honest reviews.'},ARTISAN:{CONTENT_1:'You are an',CONTENT_2:', a master craftsman of greyd.',CONTENT_3:'As part of Tier 5, the',CONTENT_4:'is the second most influential greyder behind the Giver. Having become an Artisan means you are on the cusp of climbing to the highest level to Tier 6.'},OPERATOR:{CONTENT_1:'You are an',CONTENT_2:', an advanced greyder.',CONTENT_3:'The',CONTENT_4:'is an advanced greyder with high qualifications and expertise. Based on the know-how gained from reviewing many products, you are at a level where you can comfortably produce review videos by presenting a variety of original and high-quality reviews.'},STRIVER:{CONTENT_1:'You are a',CONTENT_2:', an intermediate greyder.',CONTENT_3:'The',CONTENT_4:'is a greyder who looks to be rewarded for their achievements and success. Your enthusiasm for being authentic, challenging yourself, and spreading knowledge is definitely recognized.'},EXPLORER:{CONTENT_1:'You are an',CONTENT_2:', a novice greyder.',CONTENT_3:'The',CONTENT_4:'takes their first steps to earn rewards as a greyder. As a novice, there is much exploration and research to be done. Work diligently on the greyd 6 to expand your greyder expertise.'},PIONEER:{CONTENT_1:'You are',CONTENT_2:', a newcomer to greyd.',CONTENT_3:'The',CONTENT_4:'is a greyder who has just discovered greyd. You will need help and step by step guidance to understand the concept and details of the platform. Refer to the help page for specific guidelines and instructions on how to use greyd and become a global greyder. The more you achieve, the greater the rewards that await you.'}},DO_REVIEW:'Review',G_SIX:{AUTHENTIC:'Authentic',INFORMATIVE:'Informative',ATTRACTIVE:'Attractive',ENTERTAINING:'Entertaining',AESTHETIC:'Aesthetic',CREATIVE:'Creative'},RATE_G_SIX:'grade',SCORE_INNER:[{Authentic:0,Informative:0,Attractive:0,Entertaining:0,Aesthetic:0,Creative:0},{Authentic:10,Informative:10,Attractive:10,Entertaining:10,Aesthetic:10,Creative:10}],SCORE_OUTLINE:[{Authentic:2,Informative:2,Attractive:2,Entertaining:2,Aesthetic:2,Creative:2},{Authentic:4,Informative:4,Attractive:4,Entertaining:4,Aesthetic:4,Creative:4},{Authentic:6,Informative:6,Attractive:6,Entertaining:6,Aesthetic:6,Creative:6},{Authentic:8,Informative:8,Attractive:8,Entertaining:8,Aesthetic:8,Creative:8},{Authentic:10,Informative:10,Attractive:10,Entertaining:10,Aesthetic:10,Creative:10}],KR:'Domestic',US:'Oversea',FREE_SHIPPING:'FreeShipping',INPUT_LOWEST_ORDER_PRICE_FOR_FREE_DELIVERY:'Give lowest order price for free delivery',SHIPPING_REGION:'Shipping Region',SCORE_AUTHENTIC:[{Authentic:10,Informative:6,Attractive:6,Entertaining:6,Aesthetic:6,Creative:6},{Authentic:10,Informative:10,Attractive:10,Entertaining:10,Aesthetic:10,Creative:10}],SCORE_INFORMATIVE:[{Authentic:6,Informative:10,Attractive:6,Entertaining:6,Aesthetic:6,Creative:6},{Authentic:10,Informative:10,Attractive:10,Entertaining:10,Aesthetic:10,Creative:10}],SCORE_ATTRACTIVE:[{Authentic:6,Informative:6,Attractive:10,Entertaining:6,Aesthetic:6,Creative:6},{Authentic:10,Informative:10,Attractive:10,Entertaining:10,Aesthetic:10,Creative:10}],SCORE_ENTERTAINING:[{Authentic:6,Informative:6,Attractive:6,Entertaining:10,Aesthetic:6,Creative:6},{Authentic:10,Informative:10,Attractive:10,Entertaining:10,Aesthetic:10,Creative:10}],SCORE_AESTHETIC:[{Authentic:6,Informative:6,Attractive:6,Entertaining:6,Aesthetic:10,Creative:6},{Authentic:10,Informative:10,Attractive:10,Entertaining:10,Aesthetic:10,Creative:10}],SCORE_CREATIVE:[{Authentic:6,Informative:6,Attractive:6,Entertaining:6,Aesthetic:6,Creative:10},{Authentic:10,Informative:10,Attractive:10,Entertaining:10,Aesthetic:10,Creative:10}],G6_TITLE:'G6',G6_CONTENT_1:'specialized evaluation system for greyders.',G6_CONTENT_2:'By being able to view six different categories of evaluation, users can directly analyze the uniqueness of each individual greyder. G6 is a key feature of greyd that was introduced to shed further light on the reliability of our greyders.',G6_CONTENT_3:'The G6 is a scorecard for the review videos that greyders post and a very important factor in determining their tiers.',AUTHENTIC_DESCRIPTION:'The ability of greyders to clearly express themselves in their product reviews. It includes word choice, sentence phrasing, voice volume, tone, intonation, pronunciation, speed, gestures, etc.',INFORMATIVE_DESCRIPTION:'This ability indicates how much information greyders can efficiently deliver. Specific descriptions of the product, including product name, time of purchase, price, performance, design, and strengths and weaknesses, are included in this category and serve as the backbone of a review video.',ATTRACTIVE_DESCRIPTION:'The extent to which greyders capture the hearts of the viewers both visually and verbally and retain their attention. It includes appearance, style, aura, mood, and tone of the greyders. It includes a wide range and can vary greatly from individual to individual.',ENTERTAINING_DESCRIPTION:'This indicates how interesting and enjoyable greyders are able to make their review videos. It is the easiest way to connect with the viewers while providing fun and enjoyable content.',AESTHETIC_DESCRIPTION:'This is the ability to visually represent how a product is pleasing to the eye. Factors include lighting, background, directing, flow, effects, and sounds.',CREATIVE_DESCRIPTION:'The ability to show how creative and individualistic greyders are in their own unique styles of making reviews about products. It is a reflection of a greyder\u2019s individual personality through a novel concept or content that has not been seen before.',WITHDRAWAL_INPUT_ERROR_TITLE:'Input Error',WITHDRAWAL_INPUT_ERROR_CONTENT:'Please enter a number only',WITHDRAWAL_USER_CONTACT:'Contact',WITHDRAWAL_USER_ID:'ID Card',WITHDRAWAL_USER_AGENCY_LICENSE:'Agency License',SHARE_QR_CODE:'Share QR Code',GREYD_SIX:'greyd Six',UNRE